Flow under review:
- summary: Production success path. A sponsor calls the permissionless RaffleFactory.createRaffle, which validates the sponsor's params, deploys a fresh ERC-1167 clone and calls Raffle.initialize with msg.sender == factory. Both guards pass on the fresh storage, the one-shot flag is committed, and the zero-address checks pass (their revert can never be reached in production). The three _isProtocolDestination screens make STATICCALLs back into the factory: raffleImplementation every time, and isRaffle for destinations that have code. The clone then stores the sponsor-derived configuration and ends in Status.AwaitingPrize, and control returns to the factory for registration and prize escrow.
- trace: ["packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:97 RaffleFactory.createRaffle - permissionless external entry; nonReentrant lock acquired; sponsor supplies CreateRaffleParams", "packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:154 _validateCreateParams - prizeToken must have code (L155); sponsorRecipient != 0 (L156); prizeToken and sponsorRecipient screened against factory/USDC/VRF wrapper/implementation/isRaffle and each other (L157-169); ERC-165 IERC721 STATICCALL to prizeToken (L172); reserveEntries != 0 (L178); any failure reverts before initialize", "packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:100 createRaffle - endTime must be > block.timestamp and at most MAX_SALE_DURATION (30 days) away (L101-104)", "packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:105 createRaffle - raffleId = ++raffleCount", "packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:106 Clones.clone - CREATE of an ERC-1167 proxy to raffleImplementation (packages/contracts/node_modules/@openzeppelin/contracts/proxy/Clones.sol:57); new storage has initialized=false and status=AwaitingPrize (enum 0)", "packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:109 createRaffle - IRaffle(raffle).initialize with sponsor=msg.sender (L112), sponsor-chosen sponsorRecipient/prizeToken/prizeTokenId/reserveEntries/endTime (L113,L115,L116,L118,L119), protocolTreasury from the factory immutable (L114), raffleId (L117)", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:176 Raffle.initialize - implementation code runs via delegatecall in the clone's storage", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:177 initialize - initialized is false on the fresh clone; guard passes", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:178 initialize - msg.sender equals the factory immutable baked into the implementation; guard passes", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:179 initialize - initialized = true committed before any external call", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:181 initialize - zero-address checks on sponsor/sponsorRecipient/protocolTreasury/prizeToken pass; their revert is unreachable in production because msg.sender, RaffleFactory.sol:155-156 and factory constructor L68 already guarantee non-zero values", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:187 initialize - _isProtocolDestination(sponsor, prizeToken), then protocolTreasury (L190) and sponsorRecipient (L193), each checked against the prospective prize token", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:599 _isProtocolDestination - compares the destination with this clone, factory, USDC, VRF wrapper, prizeToken_ and the result of STATICCALL factory.raffleImplementation() (L601); the factory getter has no reentrancy lock, so it succeeds while createRaffle holds the lock", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:602 _isProtocolDestination - only for destinations with code (contract wallets, EIP-7702 accounts, a contract treasury): STATICCALL factory.isRaffle(destination) at L603", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:197 initialize - SSTORE sponsor, sponsorRecipient, protocolTreasury, prizeToken, prizeTokenId, raffleId, reserveEntries, endTime (L197-204); no setter exists afterwards", "packages/contracts/src/Raffle.sol:205 initialize - status = AwaitingPrize; returns without emitting an event", "packages/contracts/src/RaffleFactory.sol:123 createRaffle - registers raffleById/idByRaffle/isRaffle (L123-125) and continues to prize escrow at L128"]
